<title>ITALY: TENNIS-SICILIAN CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SICILIAN CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>PALERMO, Sicily 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final of the $328,000 Sicilian international tennis championship on Sunday: Karim Alami (Morocco) beat Adrian Voinea (Romania) 7-5 2-1, retired injured.</p>
</text>
